    <title>BepInEx.ConfigurationManager v19.1</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;This update adds translation support and includes translations to various languages. See the readme for usage instructions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Russian translation as a plugin-specific AutoTranslator file; measure translated labels correctly by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/MikalaiKryvusha/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/MikalaiKryvusha&quot;&gt;@MikalaiKryvusha&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5795085450&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/BepInEx/BepInEx.ConfigurationManager/issues/125&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/BepInEx/BepInEx.ConfigurationManager/pull/125/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/BepInEx/BepInEx.ConfigurationManager/pull/125&quot;&gt;#125&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add WindowSkin: let a separate plugin theme the settings window by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/MikalaiKryvusha/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/MikalaiKryvusha&quot;&gt;@MikalaiKryvusha&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5799385772&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/BepInEx/BepInEx.ConfigurationManager/issues/126&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/BepInEx/BepInEx.ConfigurationManager/pull/126/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/BepInEx/BepInEx.ConfigurationManager/pull/126&quot;&gt;#126&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add 23 translations for XUnity.AutoTranslator (CJK, European, Baltic, SE Asian, Swahili) by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/MikalaiKryvusha/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/MikalaiKryvusha&quot;&gt;@MikalaiKryvusha&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5850576740&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/BepInEx/BepInEx.ConfigurationManager/issues/129&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/BepInEx/BepInEx.ConfigurationManager/pull/129/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/BepInEx/BepInEx.ConfigurationManager/pull/129&quot;&gt;#129&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add Arabic (ar) translation by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/vfggf95565/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vfggf95565&quot;&gt;@vfggf95565&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5833766786&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/BepInEx/BepInEx.ConfigurationManager/issues/128&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/BepInEx/BepInEx.ConfigurationManager/pull/128/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/BepInEx/BepInEx.ConfigurationManager/pull/128&quot;&gt;#128&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fit the slider value box to its text instead of a fixed 50px by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/MikalaiKryvusha/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/MikalaiKryvusha&quot;&gt;@MikalaiKryvusha&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5801407638&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/BepInEx/BepInEx.ConfigurationManager/issues/127&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/BepInEx/BepInEx.ConfigurationManager/pull/127/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/BepInEx/BepInEx.ConfigurationManager/pull/127&quot;&gt;#127&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix tooltip translation through IMGUI hooks by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/angel12538/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/angel12538&quot;&gt;@angel12538&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5919169356&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/BepInEx/BepInEx.ConfigurationManager/issues/131&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/BepInEx/BepInEx.ConfigurationManager/pull/131/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/BepInEx/BepInEx.ConfigurationManager/pull/131&quot;&gt;#131&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;New Contributors&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/MikalaiKryvusha/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/MikalaiKryvusha&quot;&gt;@MikalaiKryvusha&lt;/a&gt; made their first contribution in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5795085450&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/BepInEx/BepInEx.ConfigurationManager/issues/125&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/BepInEx/BepInEx.ConfigurationManager/pull/125/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/BepInEx/BepInEx.ConfigurationManager/pull/125&quot;&gt;#125&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/vfggf95565/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vfggf95565&quot;&gt;@vfggf95565&lt;/a&gt; made their first contribution in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5833766786&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/BepInEx/BepInEx.ConfigurationManager/issues/128&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/BepInEx/BepInEx.ConfigurationManager/pull/128/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/BepInEx/BepInEx.ConfigurationManager/pull/128&quot;&gt;#128&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/angel12538/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/angel12538&quot;&gt;@angel12538&lt;/a&gt; made their first contribution in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5919169356&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/BepInEx/BepInEx.ConfigurationManager/issues/131&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/BepInEx/BepInEx.ConfigurationManager/pull/131/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/BepInEx/BepInEx.ConfigurationManager/pull/131&quot;&gt;#131&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
