    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/BepInEx/BepInEx.ConfigurationManager/releases/tag/v19.0"/>
    <title>BepInEx.ConfigurationManager v19.0</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h1&gt;What&#39;s changed&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IL2CPP - Upgrade to BepInEx6 be.785 (support games without legacy input)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set KeyboardShortcut package as obsolete - remove it from your project and use KeyboardShortcut from BepInEx6 be.785+ instead&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added targetFrameworks to nuget package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class=&quot;commit-link&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/BepInEx/BepInEx.ConfigurationManager/compare/v18.4.1...v19.0&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;v18.4.1...v19.0&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content>
