    <title>BepInEx.ConfigurationManager v18.3</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed a bug that caused an exception if DLLs that failed to load were mixed in by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/takahiro0327/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/takahiro0327&quot;&gt;@takahiro0327&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;2158964511&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/BepInEx/BepInEx.ConfigurationManager/issues/84&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/BepInEx/BepInEx.ConfigurationManager/pull/84/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/BepInEx/BepInEx.ConfigurationManager/pull/84&quot;&gt;#84&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Do not throw ArgumenNullException in ConfigSettingEntry.GetAcceptedValues by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/MrAgeo/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/MrAgeo&quot;&gt;@MrAgeo&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;2228732287&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/BepInEx/BepInEx.ConfigurationManager/issues/89&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/BepInEx/BepInEx.ConfigurationManager/pull/89/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/BepInEx/BepInEx.ConfigurationManager/pull/89&quot;&gt;#89&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
